<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS8" title="In 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.8 </span>Sensitivity analysis</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS9" title="In 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.9 </span>Efficiency analysis</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS10" title="In 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.10 </span>Error analysis</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS11" title="In 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.11 </span>Case study and visualisation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS12" title="In 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.12 </span>Threats to validity</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS13" title="In 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.13 </span>Experimental findings summary</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Discussion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSSx1" title="In 6 Conclusion ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Acknowledgements</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSSx2" title="In 6 Conclusion ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Disclosure of Interests.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
