<section id="S4.SS6.SSSx3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Cross-project robustness</h4>

<div id="S4.SS6.SSSx3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS6.SSSx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Cross-project robustness ‣ 4.6 Main results ‣ 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> shows VulnAgent-X retains highest relative F1 in cross-project evaluation (no training project in test split), demonstrating robustness to distribution shift.</p>
</div>
