<section id="S4.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.8 </span>Sensitivity analysis</h3>

<div id="S4.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 4.8 Sensitivity analysis ‣ 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows performance improves with larger <math id="S4.SS8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K/B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K/B</annotation></semantics></math> but saturates (bounded evidence is cost-effective). Table <a href="#S4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 4.8 Sensitivity analysis ‣ 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> confirms default confidence thresholds (<math id="S4.SS8.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\text{high }}=0.82" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>high </mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.82</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\text{high }}=0.82</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS8.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\text{low }}=0.48" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>low </mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\text{low }}=0.48</annotation></semantics></math>) balance performance and cost.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Sensitivity analysis for <math id="S4.T5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.T5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> (PrimeVul).</figcaption>
