<section id="S4.SS9" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.9 </span>Efficiency analysis</h3>

<div id="S4.SS9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ 4.9 Efficiency analysis ‣ 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> shows VulnAgent-X reduces average cost vs. "always-full" execution (39.6% fewer tokens, 35.1% less time) via early exit (62.4% samples resolved before dynamic verification).</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Efficiency analysis on PrimeVul.</figcaption>
