<section id="S4.SS10" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.10 </span>Error analysis</h3>

<div id="S4.SS10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Manual inspection of false positives/negatives (PrimeVul/JULY) identifies key failure modes (Table <a href="#S4.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ 4.10 Error analysis ‣ 4 Experimental Design and Results ‣ VulnAgent-X: A Layered Agentic Framework for Repository-Level Vulnerability Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>): incomplete environmental knowledge (27.0%) and implicit helper-function semantics (23.5%) are top sources, indicating gaps in build/runtime context capture.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Error breakdown (sampled incorrect predictions).</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S4.T8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Error category</span></th>
<th id="S4.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S4.T8.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Proportion</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T8.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T8.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S4.T8.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Missing build/runtime assumptions</span></td>
<td id="S4.T8.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><math id="S4.T8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="27.0\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">27.0</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">27.0\%</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T8.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T8.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S4.T8.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Implicit helper-function semantics</span></td>
<td id="S4.T8.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><math id="S4.T8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="23.5\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">23.5</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">23.5\%</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T8.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T8.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S4.T8.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Incorrect reachability estimation</span></td>
<td id="S4.T8.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><math id="S4.T8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="18.0\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">18.0</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">18.0\%</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
